    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23592" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαψιλ-εύομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>abound,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγέλαις ἐλεφάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.Byz.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					3.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be anxious, careworn,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάτινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>1 Ki.</u>
					10.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>spend lavishly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				708.34
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Istropolis</span>), Andronic.Rhod.<i><span class="en">
				p.577
			</span></i> M.; <i>bestow lavishly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς αἰτοῦσι τὸ ἔλεος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					104
				</span></i>
			 H., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eustr.
				<u>in EN</u>
				91.20
			</span></i>.</div>
